== Effects ==
* Upon use, pressing an attack direction will cause a swipe attack with high knockback and 3 damage.
** The swipe scales in size with Isaac's size.
** The swipe will appear further from Isaac the higher his [[range]] is.
** The swipe can be used to open {{e|Spiked Chest}}s and {{e|Mimic Chest}}s without taking damage.
** The swipe can be used to block bullets.
** The swipe can be aimed at any direction.
* Swiping a [[pickup]] on the floor will add it to the bag. The bag's contents cannot be dropped. Up to 8 pickups can be stored.
** Double pickups like {{e|Double Heart}}s will add two copies to the bag. {{E|Blended Heart}}s will add one red heart and one soul heart.
** {{e|Sticky Nickel}}s can't be picked up unless unstuck.
** {{e|Chest}}s and {{e|Grab Bag|text=Sacks}} can't be picked up, but can be opened with a swipe even behind obstacles.
** If Isaac has enough money to buy a pickup from a {{R|Shop}}, using Bag of Crafting on that pickup will purchase it and automatically add it to the bag.
* Once 8 pickups are held in the bag, the bag can be used once more to spawn an item pedestal.
** If a recipe would result in an item that hasn't yet been unlocked, a random item will be crafted instead.
* There are a total of 29 different types of consumables that can be placed in the bag. The ordering does not matter for the outcome.

'''As {{c|Tainted Cain}}:'''

* If pickups are collected after the max of 8 is reached, the contents shift left and up, deleting the top left slot and adding at the bottom right. Tapping the switch key cycles the bag's contents left and up in a loop, making it possible to choose which pickup to overwrite.
* Once 8 pickups are held in the bag, the bag will show a preview what would be crafted. Holding down the Use Pill/Card button will craft the item and place it directly in Tainted Cain's inventory.
** Crafting an activated item while already holding one will turn the old one into pickups like collecting it would.
** {{cu|Blind}} hides the crafting preview.

'''Item Tags:'''

The Bag of Crafting respects item tags, and which items are available during the current run. This includes the following:

* As {{c|The Lost}}, {{i|Birthright}} prevents items with the [[Item Tags nolostbr|<code>nolostbr</code> item tag]] from appearing when using the Bag of Crafting.
* As {{c|Tainted Lost}}, items without the [[Item Tags offensive|<code>offensive</code> item tag]] will not appear.
* As {{c|Keeper}}, items with the [[Item Tags nokeeper|<code>nokeeper</code> item tag]] will not appear.
* In {{mode|greed|greedier}}[[Greed Mode|Greed Mode or Greedier Mode]], items with the [[Item Tags nogreed|<code>nogreed</code> item tag]] will not appear.
* In [[Daily Challenge]]s, items with the [[Item Tags nodaily|<code>nodaily</code> item tag]] will not appear.
* In [[Challenges|Challenge]], items with the [[Item Tags nochallenge|<code>nochallenge</code> item tag]] will not appear.
* If {{t|NO!}} is held, active items will be skipped.
* If {{i|Sacred Orb}} is held, items with Quality 0 or 1 will be skipped. If a recipe that can only result in a quality 0-1 item is put in the bag, it will replace the item with {{i|Breakfast}} instead.

== Component Types and Qualities ==
[[File:Bag of Crafting UI symbols.png|256x128px]]<br />
The cumulative quality of the components impacts the [[item quality|quality]] of the item received. The pickups belonging to each component type and their qualities are listed as below. The item received can be from the [[Treasure Room (Item Pool)|Treasure Room item pool]] (1× chance), [[Shop (Item Pool)|Shop item pool]] (2× chance), [[Boss (Item Pool)|Boss Room item pool]] (2× chance), or one of the pools listed in the table below. The pools in the table below require at least 1 of the corresponding component. For example, [[Devil Room (Item Pool)|Devil Room items]] require at least 1 {{e|Black Heart}}.

If the recipe chooses an item from Devil, Angel, or Secret Room pools, the total component quality is lowered by 5 before the resulting item quality, and consequently the resulting item, is determined.

