== Synergies ==
* {{i|Abyss}} / {{i|Void}}: Can be used in conjunction with Bag of Crafting to gain a large amount of locusts/stat boosts.
* {{i|Serpent's Kiss}}: Due to the high amount of {{e|Black Heart}}s generated by the item, they can be utilized to either craft a high amount of [[Devil Room (Item Pool)|Devil Room items]], or a ludicrous amount of {{i|Brimstone}}, due to its recipe always consisting of eight {{e|Black Heart}}s.
* {{Book of Belial synergy|description=Collecting {{e|Red Heart}}s, {{e|Half Red Heart}}s, or {{e|Double Heart}}s with this item has a chance to transform them into {{e|Black Heart}}s. When a heart is transformed in this way, a special sound plays and a black smoke puff appears. Does not work with {{E|Scared Heart}}s.}}
* {{Book of Virtues synergy|description=Spawns a random wisp when an item is crafted.}}
* {{T|Pay to Win}} / {{P|XX - Judgement?}}: Can be a powerful combination for when Isaac is not {{C|Tainted Cain}} as he can craft multiple item pedestals in the {{r|Treasure Room}} which can be rerolled repeatedly using the generated {{m|Shop Restock Machine}}.

== Interactions ==
* {{t|Butter!}}: Bag of Crafting is dropped before pickups can be collected or items crafted.
* {{i|Car Battery}}: No effect.
* {{i|The Ludovico Technique}}: Swiping the bag at the Ludovico tear will bat it in the direction of the knockback.
* {{i|Sacred Orb}}: Sacred Orb prevents crafting quality 1 and 0 items, typically resulting in them being replaced by quality 2 items. If a recipe that can only result in a quality 0-1 item is put in the bag, it will replace the item with Breakfast instead.
* {{c|Tainted Eden}}: If the Tainted Eden loses Bag of Crafting from a reroll while it contains pickups, then rerolls back into it at a later point, it will still contain the pickups.
* {{p|Wild Card}}: Holding up Bag of Crafting counts as an active item use for Wild Card, and can be replicated.
* {{p|? Card}}: Does NOT give a free duplicate of whatever the full bag would create.

