== Trivia ==
* There are <math>\left(\!\!\binom{29}{8}\!\!\right) = \binom{29+8-1}{8} = 30,260,340</math>, or about 30.3 million, combinations of pickups and consumables that can be used in the Bag of Crafting. The item chosen is based on a formula mapping the chosen consumables, item weights, and quality values into a single outcome. On average, about 1/4th of all items will represent over 1/2 of all recipes.
* The average consumable value is ~4.31.
* Bag of Crafting's item description hints to {{i|The D6}}'s item description as well as {{c|Tainted Cain}}'s description, implying that "Destiny" is the items that will appear in a given seed.
* Bag of Crafting used to have the "<code>[[Item Tags nochallenge|nochallenge]]</code>" and "<code>[[Item Tags nodaily|nodaily]]</code>" tag instead of the "<code>[[Item Tags offensive|offensive]]</code>" tag. The resulting changes now allow it to be encountered on [[challenge]]s, [[daily challenge]]s, and by {{c|Tainted Lost}}.
* It is possible, with the crafting of 4x [[R Key]]s, to get every [[Completion Marks|Completion Mark]] for a character in a single run, except the ones for [[Greed Mode]].

